            <title>出了汗也会清爽的味道：口碑国货高夫男士淡香水 170 → 43.5 元远低超级补贴</title>
            <link>https://lapin.ithome.com/html/digi/981374.htm</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://lapin.ithome.com/html/digi/981374.htm</guid>
            <pubDate></pubDate>
            <updated>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:49:47 GMT</updated>
                
                
            <content:encoded>
                <![CDATA[
                    
